# A PARAMETER HELD FIVE VARIANTS OF ONE SHAPE BEFORE THE SIXTH CAME. What a node holds on the way depends on the order in which things come to it, so only what it holds in the end names a family: the five were one within the six, and the image of a large program hung on the order.
# area({ a, b, c, d: 1 }); area({ a, b, c, e: 1 }); ..; area(same({ a, b, c, i: 1 }));   function area(s) { return 1; }   function same(s) { return s; }
